        <mxCell id="xX_1lbu7gcvtT0vsC2jS-5" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;wjtrjn&quot; data-start=&quot;1026&quot; data-end=&quot;1040&quot; class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;5. Integration Layer&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1042&quot; data-end=&quot;1088&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;There are 2-3 integrated application which is talking to LoopLon. We don&#39;t want to interact them with LoopLon directly since it can be messy. So, All integrations happens through this layer which acts as gateway.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
